<title>USA: Armey says any U.S. budget pact will have tax cut.</title>
<headline>Armey says any U.S. budget pact will have tax cut.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>House Majority Leader Dick Armey, R-Texas, said Tuesday that any budget agreement with the White House would include a tax cut.</p>
<p>&quot;If there is a budget agreement between the White House and the Congress, it will include a tax component that will be significant,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
<p>Senate Majority Leader Trent Lott, R-Miss., said he believes there will be a capital gains tax cut this year.</p>
</text>
